              "Scales up to 16 TB Heaps",
              "Zero stop-the-world stalls"
            ]
          },
          "takeaway": "Modern G1GC and ZGC Deliver High Throughput With Sub-Millisecond Latency Pauses",
          "tag": "G1GC VS ZGC"
